<title>USA: ARCO Chemical Co Q3 net declined.</title>
<headline>ARCO Chemical Co Q3 net declined.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTOWN SQUARE, Pa. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Millions of Dollars except per share data)</p>
<p>					     Third Quarter  Nine Months</p>
<p>						1996   1995   1996   1995</p>
<p> Total revenues			  $1,035  $999 $2,976 $3,289</p>
<p>		NET INCOME		     97   117    284    393</p>
<p>  Net income per common share	  1.00  1.21   2.94   4.08</p>
<p>NOTES: The effective full year tax rate for 1996 is expected to be 29.6 pct.</p>
<p>Depreciation/amortization expense for the nine months ended 9/30/96 and 9/30/95 was $165 million and $176 million, respectively. -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
